以JSON格式输出结果，示例输出如下：
示例1：
{"D11":{"overtime_hours":20,"total_hours":120}, "A12":{"overtime_hours":6,"total_hours":14}, "B13":{"overtime_hours":1,"total_hours":10}}
示例2：
{"D11":{"overtime_hours":20,"total_hours":120}, "A12":{"overtime_hours":6,"total_hours":14}}

